    "text": "<p>&nbsp;The correct observation in the following reaction is:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Sucrose</mi><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>Cleavage</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>Hydrolysis</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>Gly</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cosidic</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>bond</mi></mrow></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Reagent</mi><mrow><mi>Seliw</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>anoff</mi></mrow></munderover><mo>?</mo></math></p>"
